{title: Wade in the Water}
{artist: Traditional spiritual}
{genre: Gospel}
{flow: Meditative}
{style: Spiritual}
{key: Em}
{tempo: 88}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_chorus}
[Em]Wade in the water, wade in the [Am]water, children
[Em]Wade in the water
God's a-gonna [B7]trouble the [Em]water
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Em]See that band all dressed in red
God's a-gonna [B7]trouble the [Em]water
[Em]Looks like the band that Moses led
God's a-gonna [B7]trouble the [Em]water
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Em]See that band all dressed in white
God's a-gonna [B7]trouble the [Em]water
[Em]Looks like the band of the Israelite
God's a-gonna [B7]trouble the [Em]water
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Em]If you don't believe I've been redeemed
God's a-gonna [B7]trouble the [Em]water
[Em]Just follow me down to the Jordan's stream
God's a-gonna [B7]trouble the [Em]water
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
